{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Just a Stay at the Inn&quot; is a short horror game inspired by titles like <i>Exit 8</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You thought it was just an ordinary stay at a traditional Japanese inn,<br>but unsettling anomalies begin to occur one after another...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you're new to <i>Exit 8</i>\u00a0style games, it's designed to be easy to play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: About 10\u201330 minutes per run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random anomalies that change with each playthrough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eerie atmosphere set in a Japanese ryokan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls and no game over mean you can play casually.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple epilogues.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD</strong>: Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse</strong>: Look around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>E</strong>: Operate the elevator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left Click</strong>: Read notes / Progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Esc</strong>: Pause / Exit</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Data</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can reset discovered anomaly data from the Options menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some anomalies appear only once; if you want to see them again, please reset your data.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming, Let\u2019s Play videos, and monetization are all allowed!<br>Please credit the title and developer (&quot;Hakoniwa Prot&quot;) when possible.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4066470?t=1759298786","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4066470?t=1759298786","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066470/1acafff9333f879bb10eba503d666c9eaa9c458c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759298786","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066470/1acafff9333f879bb10eba503d666c9eaa9c458c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759298786","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Just a Stay at the Inn&quot; is a short horror game inspired by titles like <i>Exit 8</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You thought it was just an ordinary stay at a traditional Japanese inn,<br>but unsettling anomalies begin to occur one after another...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you're new to <i>Exit 8</i>\u00a0style games, it's designed to be easy to play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: About 10\u201330 minutes per run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random anomalies that change with each playthrough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eerie atmosphere set in a Japanese ryokan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls and no game over mean you can play casually.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple epilogues.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD</strong>: Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse</strong>: Look around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>E</strong>: Operate the elevator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left Click</strong>: Read notes / Progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Esc</strong>: Pause / Exit</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Data</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can reset discovered anomaly data from the Options menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some anomalies appear only once; if you want to see them again, please reset your data.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming, Let\u2019s Play videos, and monetization are all allowed!<br>Please credit the title and developer (&quot;Hakoniwa Prot&quot;) when possible.</p>","developers":["\u7bb1\u5eadProt"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066470/f9ab279a119d8852a67f631b5d18ad39a0e704c7/header.jpg?t=1759298786","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4066470/1671739743/ec8ee8577dd4b574844c1474896a38e889fe9b80/1758952688/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759298785","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4066470/1671739743/ec8ee8577dd4b574844c1474896a38e889fe9b80/1758952688/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759298785","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4066470/1671739743/ec8ee8577dd4b574844c1474896a38e889fe9b80/1758952688/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759298785","id":257207264,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257207264/movie480.mp4?t=1759298785","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257207264/movie_max.mp4?t=1759298785"},"name":"\u30c6\u30a3\u30fc\u30b6\u30fc","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s